OL,3,GNEWSAVandalised car park to reopen
OL,4,Aafter #463k revamp
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council-owned car park temporarily
OL,7,Fshut in January after extensive and
OL,8,Fsustained vandalism is set to reopen
OL,9,Fafter a #463,000 refurbishment.
OL,11,FStafferton Way car park in Maidenhead
OL,12,Fwas closed after the damage made it
OL,13,F"unsuitable for public use", the Royal
OL,14,FBorough of Windsor and Maidenhead said.
OL,16,FThe council said the refurb at the
OL,17,F476-space facility would "protect the
OL,18,Fasset for the future and provide a
OL,19,Fsafer, more welcoming experience for
OL,20,Fresidents, commuters and visitors."
